{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530470/extras/406f1b1244bf77f05671a8f738f3f4b9.webp?t=1757476760\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530470/extras/406f1b1244bf77f05671a8f738f3f4b9.poster.webp?t=1757476760\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=338 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Garden of Witches</strong> is a fast-paced action roguelike where you\u2019ll experience exhilarating combat, precise mechanics, and the thrill of crafting powerful synergies. To beat the game, you\u2019ll need to prepare carefully, master enemy patterns, and strike with style. Shape your build from a randomized pool of spells, upgrades, and relics, and outsmart the other witches that stand in your way.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Host a Tea Party with Witches</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Garden is slowly deteriorating, and it\u2019s all thanks to the idle and selfish witches who\u2019ve lost their sense of duty. To save the Garden, you must beat some sense into them and round them up for the tea party.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530470/extras/64b02125c9678f3d1b16f96c1409f796.webp?t=1757476760\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530470/extras/64b02125c9678f3d1b16f96c1409f796.poster.webp?t=1757476760\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=338 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Enchanted Garden of Witches</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fading sanctuary. Rebellious witches. Secrets hidden behind the curtain of dreams. Emotional graphics and immersive storytelling breathe life into a world on the verge of collapse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530470/extras/266b9424f354f7f41249d914bad6b8a5.webp?t=1757476760\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530470/extras/266b9424f354f7f41249d914bad6b8a5.poster.webp?t=1757476760\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=338 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Strategy, Synergy, and Style</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Sil, the Thread Witch. Wield giant scissors to protect your precious sanctuary and persuade the other unruly witches to gather for the tea party. After each battle, you\u2019ll face critical decisions, choosing spells, upgrades, and relics that define your playstyle. Harness the mysterious power of witches and \u201cpersuade\u201d the other witches in the garden with your own unique and strategic combat style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530470/extras/78b04088d2e01601dbc53cd63c5e4385.webp?t=1757476760\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530470/extras/78b04088d2e01601dbc53cd63c5e4385.poster.webp?t=1757476760\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=338 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How to Convince a Witch</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every witch has distinct attack patterns, and they won\u2019t go down easily. Study their movements, time your counterattacks, and use everything in your arsenal to win them over. Precision and quick thinking are your keys to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530470/extras/aded5bd0aaa4e5cedc1fb1b681d6b385.webp?t=1757476760\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530470/extras/aded5bd0aaa4e5cedc1fb1b681d6b385.poster.webp?t=1757476760\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=338 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What Matters is an Unyielding Heart</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even if you hit a wall, don\u2019t give up! Each death is a step forward, unlocking new abilities and permanent growth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530470/extras/38eea1c25f8db8fca102050d37433c06.webp?t=1757476760\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530470/extras/38eea1c25f8db8fca102050d37433c06.poster.webp?t=1757476760\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=338 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Early Access</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the current Early Access version, you can enjoy the following content:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The full main story (5 chapters)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A deep combat system built on flexible attribute-based builds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A progression system that highlights strategic elements such as attribute synergies, relics, and weapon variations as you progress through each chapter</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Light endgame content focused on record achievement</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Looking ahead, we plan on adding new areas, bosses, endgame content, and a variety of additional features one by one. We\u2019re committed to delivering a game experience that continually evolves with consistent updates and improvements until our game is ready for its 1.0 release.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your feedback will shape the future of our game. We hope you will join us and be a part of the journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530470/extras/3e6d08f70dd6a261d4a53f3f1bd6ca80.avif?t=1757476760\" width=600 height=427 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2530470?t=1757476760","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530470/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757476760","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530470/6a1383fec027f7e77e863d0cc5ef3c3ead573d7f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757476760","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530470/6a1383fec027f7e77e863d0cc5ef3c3ead573d7f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757476760","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>Just Updated</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530470/extras/b6a3977027803c939662dd788534600a.avif?t=1757476760\" width=960 height=240 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nahatra\u2019s growth has caused side effects that are shaking up the Garden. To stabilize the Garden, help the troubled <strong>Swamp Witch, Maydel</strong>, solve her problem and invite her to the tea party. Of course, like other domains in the Garden, Maydel\u2019s swamp won\u2019t be particularly friendly to Sil.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530470/extras/46c277baed83447c20b35c3a75471dc4.poster.avif?t=1757476760\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530470/extras/46c277baed83447c20b35c3a75471dc4.webm?t=1757476760\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530470/extras/46c277baed83447c20b35c3a75471dc4.mp4?t=1757476760\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike previous chapters, this epilogue is structured as a <strong>single map</strong>. Countless waves of enemies and successive mid-bosses will block Sil\u2019s path. <strong>Defeat enemies within the time limit to earn greater rewards, and complete your build to take down the main boss!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>New Weapon: Singing Scissors</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530470/extras/60bc8cfa5268311feeaef595065cc38a.poster.avif?t=1757476760\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530470/extras/60bc8cfa5268311feeaef595065cc38a.webm?t=1757476760\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530470/extras/60bc8cfa5268311feeaef595065cc38a.mp4?t=1757476760\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After helping Maydel solve her problem, she will gift Sil with a <strong>new weapon, Singing Scissors,</strong> as a token of gratitude. When activated, Singing Scissors will perform <strong>ranged attacks for a set duration</strong>. We hope this will inspire new build combinations.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>New Special Ability</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530470/extras/da32412648c27a3625c0e549cb7c7855.poster.avif?t=1757476760\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530470/extras/da32412648c27a3625c0e549cb7c7855.webm?t=1757476760\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530470/extras/da32412648c27a3625c0e549cb7c7855.mp4?t=1757476760\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Maydel\u2019s swamp domain, a <strong>special ability</strong> powered by Maydel becomes available. It can be used via a new action button and <strong>enhances Sil\u2019s abilities in various ways</strong>. This ability is a unique system <strong>available only in Maydel\u2019s swamp domain</strong>.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530470/extras/406f1b1244bf77f05671a8f738f3f4b9.webp?t=1757476760\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530470/extras/406f1b1244bf77f05671a8f738f3f4b9.poster.webp?t=1757476760\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=338 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Garden of Witches</strong> is a fast-paced action roguelike where you\u2019ll experience exhilarating combat, precise mechanics, and the thrill of crafting powerful synergies. To beat the game, you\u2019ll need to prepare carefully, master enemy patterns, and strike with style. Shape your build from a randomized pool of spells, upgrades, and relics, and outsmart the other witches that stand in your way.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Host a Tea Party with Witches</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Garden is slowly deteriorating, and it\u2019s all thanks to the idle and selfish witches who\u2019ve lost their sense of duty. To save the Garden, you must beat some sense into them and round them up for the tea party.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530470/extras/64b02125c9678f3d1b16f96c1409f796.webp?t=1757476760\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530470/extras/64b02125c9678f3d1b16f96c1409f796.poster.webp?t=1757476760\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=338 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Enchanted Garden of Witches</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fading sanctuary. Rebellious witches. Secrets hidden behind the curtain of dreams. Emotional graphics and immersive storytelling breathe life into a world on the verge of collapse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530470/extras/266b9424f354f7f41249d914bad6b8a5.webp?t=1757476760\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530470/extras/266b9424f354f7f41249d914bad6b8a5.poster.webp?t=1757476760\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=338 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Strategy, Synergy, and Style</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Sil, the Thread Witch. Wield giant scissors to protect your precious sanctuary and persuade the other unruly witches to gather for the tea party. After each battle, you\u2019ll face critical decisions, choosing spells, upgrades, and relics that define your playstyle. Harness the mysterious power of witches and \u201cpersuade\u201d the other witches in the garden with your own unique and strategic combat style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530470/extras/78b04088d2e01601dbc53cd63c5e4385.webp?t=1757476760\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530470/extras/78b04088d2e01601dbc53cd63c5e4385.poster.webp?t=1757476760\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=338 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How to Convince a Witch</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every witch has distinct attack patterns, and they won\u2019t go down easily. Study their movements, time your counterattacks, and use everything in your arsenal to win them over. Precision and quick thinking are your keys to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530470/extras/aded5bd0aaa4e5cedc1fb1b681d6b385.webp?t=1757476760\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530470/extras/aded5bd0aaa4e5cedc1fb1b681d6b385.poster.webp?t=1757476760\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=338 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What Matters is an Unyielding Heart</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even if you hit a wall, don\u2019t give up! Each death is a step forward, unlocking new abilities and permanent growth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530470/extras/38eea1c25f8db8fca102050d37433c06.webp?t=1757476760\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530470/extras/38eea1c25f8db8fca102050d37433c06.poster.webp?t=1757476760\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=338 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Early Access</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the current Early Access version, you can enjoy the following content:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The full main story (5 chapters)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A deep combat system built on flexible attribute-based builds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A progression system that highlights strategic elements such as attribute synergies, relics, and weapon variations as you progress through each chapter</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Light endgame content focused on record achievement</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Looking ahead, we plan on adding new areas, bosses, endgame content, and a variety of additional features one by one. We\u2019re committed to delivering a game experience that continually evolves with consistent updates and improvements until our game is ready for its 1.0 release.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your feedback will shape the future of our game. We hope you will join us and be a part of the journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530470/extras/3e6d08f70dd6a261d4a53f3f1bd6ca80.avif?t=1757476760\" width=600 height=427 /></span></p>","developers":["Team Tapas"],"dlc":[3624950],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530470/3f8f9fa7b5dcfc6e60ba39a13925ddfa40610e58/header.jpg?t=1757476760","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9Team Tapas, Ltd. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2530470/1358505330/02d218f65db82ad89d0dd66b75e0e979c2c73208/1750856176/dash_av1.mpd?t=1750915800","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2530470/1358505330/02d218f65db82ad89d0dd66b75e0e979c2c73